{"title":"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solutions_1_and_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solutions 1 and 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/1/1f1d31dfac94050b4d1d7896c826f3630951b513.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_1, S_2, S_3, \\cdots, S_{10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"139\" height=\"16\" /> has the property that every term beginning with the third is the sum of the previous two.  That is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/d/49d16ad7dec282dc9ee086290f9aa43ba22b0b78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[S_n = S_{n-2} + S_{n-1} \\text{ for } n \\ge 3.\\]\" width=\"219\" height=\"15\" /> Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/2/f92300ed458272b30562cfdfaefdd2febf5376c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_9 = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d182fd61fa45b7b0a73697cc1ffdaea87333df34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_7 = 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />.  What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/7/927ca6f264730b7f22ea5e06ee7ac6872819f94e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"17\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/1/c31b1dc65ee21b37c677f982eff4bd0f94d80c9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 10\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 12\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 16\\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"376\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solutions_1_and_2\">Solutions 1 and 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solutions 1 and 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solution 1:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/2/f92300ed458272b30562cfdfaefdd2febf5376c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_9 = 110$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d182fd61fa45b7b0a73697cc1ffdaea87333df34.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_7 = 42$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/1/bf1340fd5ca32ae5e165acc39bafe3f1456c6fc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_8 = S_9 - S_ 7 = 110 - 42 = 68$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"236\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/d/1fd6ce2fa2c4a18b3b8eb5ea9c237947c746a1e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_6 = S_8 - S_7 = 68 - 42 = 26$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"227\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/6/0d6dd2209711d808f34a95d1bff70dac2cf0e0a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_5 = S_7 - S_6 = 42 - 26 = 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"227\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/2/242bfdd4125ca626d9903d244d1ad5deca88ba32.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S_4 = S_6 - S_5 = 26 - 16 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"227\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2c7554b5d32e6696d5f2f14c5752b2569705654.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p><br />\n== Solution 2 ==(first time writing something like this, sorry if bad structure)(no I did not write solution 1)\n</p><p>S3=S1+S2, S4=S2+S1+S2=2*S1 +S2, S5=3*S1+2*S2, S6=5*S1+3*S2, S7=8*S1+5*S2, S8=13*S1+8*S2, S9=21*S1+13*S2. S9=110, S7=42. 8*S1+5*S2=42. 21*S1+13*S2=110. 105*S1+65*S2=550, 104*S1+65*S2=546. S1=550-546=4. S2:21*4+13*S2=110. 13*S2=26. S2=2. S3=S1+S2=6. S4=S2+S3= <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/c/e2c7554b5d32e6696d5f2f14c5752b2569705654.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C) }{10}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"65\" height=\"28\" /> (idk how to open a new section so sorry) \n</p><p>~Nyx3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/CCjcMVtkVaQ\">https://youtu.be/CCjcMVtkVaQ</a>\n~sugar_rush\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A\">2013 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2013_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2013 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/i